    <p class="intro-wide">Supervision, consultation and training are three different things, and
    most therapists arrive wanting one of them in particular. All three run online across Texas,
    apart from the parts that deliberately happen on a trail or with horses. If you are an
    associate working toward licensure, start with the first.</p>
    <div class="pathways">
      <a href="/for-therapists/lpc-supervision/">
        <h3>LPC supervision</h3>
        <p>Your 3,000 hours, supervised online anywhere in Texas. $425 a month, four hours,
          trauma-informed. One opening in spring 2027.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/for-therapists/emdr-consultation/">
        <h3>EMDR consultation</h3>
        <p>Hours toward certification with an EMDRIA Approved Consultant. $185, online, focused
